      "created_at": "2019-10-01T13:15:17.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>I was surprised at how long it took to find Inspiring Presence, but I didn't need it. Tachyon even got to take Voss down by Blitzing practically every one of her Burst cards back into her deck after a pair of Lightspeed Barrages. Nothing tricky or particularly difficult about this one.</p>",
