      "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"gossamerica2\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/g/51bf81/48.png\" class=\"avatar\"> gossamerica2:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>The most damage the heroes took was from Tachyon beating herself up.  As usual, Infrared Eyepiece is your friend.  Use it and you’ll be fine.</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>No lie that it was an easy game, but where did you find an Eyepiece? Didn’t see any of those or Impromptu Inventions (or Pervasive Red Dusts or Inspiring Presences for that matter) over the 6-8 rounds it took to win.</p>",
