    {
      "id": 228770,
      "name": "gossamerica2",
      "username": "gossamerica2",
      "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/g/51bf81/{size}.png",
      "created_at": "2019-10-01T20:24:21.000Z",
      "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote group-playtesters\" data-username=\"flamethrower49\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/f/838e76/48.png\" class=\"avatar\"> flamethrower49:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>No lie that it was an easy game, but where did you find an Eyepiece? Didn’t see any of those or Impromptu Inventions (or Pervasive Red Dusts or Inspiring Presences for that matter) over the 6-8 rounds it took to win.</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>With extra card draw from Legacy &amp; Tachyon, IR eyepiece came out pretty quickly for me.  I’ve played it a couple of times, either shuffling trash into hero decks to get rid of Maintenance Level or not.  Either way, I had no problem getting it.</p>\n<p>I agree that Inspiring Presence was quite buried, but also unnecessary.</p>",
